                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "94268663-3504-3036-86dc-dceec6316d31",
                        "entry_id": "d72a8b9c-ffb1-34c1-b726-7798ae9cd0a9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "With speed; in a rapid manner."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1a179e44-43c9-4b45-bfc0-f5e31f72bb7c",
                                "sense_id": "94268663-3504-3036-86dc-dceec6316d31",
                                "text": "She packed her case rapidly and hurried out."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9538ee31-c85a-4a01-9836-c055f6c9a80b",
                                "sense_id": "94268663-3504-3036-86dc-dceec6316d31",
                                "text": "We expressed our readiness, and in ten minutes were in the station wagon, rolling rapidly down the long drive, for it was then after nine. We passed on the way the van of the guests from Asquith."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d8a0c03c-1365-4063-bf9c-880347e8bbed",
                                "sense_id": "94268663-3504-3036-86dc-dceec6316d31",
                                "text": "Since the launch early last year of […] two Silicon Valley start-ups offering free education through MOOCs, massive open online courses, the ivory towers of academia have been shaken to their foundations. University brands built in some cases over centuries have been forced to contemplate the possibility that information technology will rapidly make their existing business model obsolete."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cd1dd84f-136b-46ee-940f-a76569f4a305",
                                "sense_id": "94268663-3504-3036-86dc-dceec6316d31",
                                "text": "Typically for the 'get-on-with-it' era, the railway and military worked like demons to restore the vital rail link. The crater was rapidly filled in and the earth tamped solid, the wreckage was removed by breakdown trains, new rails and sleepers were rushed forward by willing hands, and US Army bulldozers piled in. By 2020 on the same day, both tracks were open for traffic again where there had been a gaping pit just hours before."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2fedc55e-78e7-4412-a12e-2172cf45e8eb",
                                "sense_id": "94268663-3504-3036-86dc-dceec6316d31",
                                "text": "But even as he announced the military operation, he appeared to be rapidly trying to get himself back to the middle by insisting that the strike was a one-off and that he continues to seek peace."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9823fa1b-bf1b-4c06-8611-b758e507d413",
                        "source_entry_id": "d72a8b9c-ffb1-34c1-b726-7798ae9cd0a9",
                        "source_sense_id": "94268663-3504-3036-86dc-dceec6316d31",
                        "source_sense_description": "with speed",
                        "target_lang_word": "rapidement",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "rapidement",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0e3c2172-e072-36f6-bf44-ef0b7308b39e",
                                        "entry_id": "ae17a514-c1bb-3525-adbf-4368a3d8558c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Avec rapidité ; d’une manière rapide."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ce8bc542-a7f4-444f-b45b-73a23cad2339",
                                                "sense_id": "0e3c2172-e072-36f6-bf44-ef0b7308b39e",
                                                "text": "Autrefois, nos écorces se vendaient à vil prix, et nos cuirs n’avaient pas une grande valeur ; mais nos écorces et nos cuirs, une fois bonifiés, la rivière nous permit de construire des moulins à tan, il nous vint des tanneurs dont le commerce s’accrut rapidement."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b6ad5e8a-db82-463b-bad0-c28b1b536236",
                                                "sense_id": "0e3c2172-e072-36f6-bf44-ef0b7308b39e",
                                                "text": "Mais, depuis la bataille de Tolbiac et la conversion de Clovis, l’Église eut ses coudées franches et put rapidement asseoir son influence à travers le territoire."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1038d086-706f-4675-abd6-240a418372a2",
                                                "sense_id": "0e3c2172-e072-36f6-bf44-ef0b7308b39e",
                                                "text": "Cependant, il convient de retenir que les honoraires du radiesthésiste ne doivent pas être excessifs, sans quoi il perdrait rapidement sa clientèle."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7e4e94b8-0266-461e-bc26-727a2c019352",
                                                "sense_id": "0e3c2172-e072-36f6-bf44-ef0b7308b39e",
                                                "text": "Les aliments détaillés en menus morceaux sont sautés très rapidement avec très peu de matière grasse dans un récipient hémisphérique placé sur un brûleur très puissant."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c2fd267a-5570-372c-9115-f64161c88480",
                                        "entry_id": "ae17a514-c1bb-3525-adbf-4368a3d8558c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "À grande vitesse."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9f044259-ae05-4acf-b2cb-2d802ea94289",
                                                "sense_id": "c2fd267a-5570-372c-9115-f64161c88480",
                                                "text": "J’aime bien rouler rapidement mais cela fait mal aux cervicales et aux bras, je dois demander des arrêts plus fréquents."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7ea27eda-dac3-3f72-9ffa-0cd7da686de1",
                                        "entry_id": "ae17a514-c1bb-3525-adbf-4368a3d8558c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Dans peu de temps ; en peu de temps."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "63b1a767-1789-4756-a0f1-35460ca5179b",
                                                "sense_id": "7ea27eda-dac3-3f72-9ffa-0cd7da686de1",
                                                "text": "Sans doute eut-il peur que nous nous inquiétassions alors pour sa santé car il n'aborda rapidement plus le sujet et fit gauchement mine de s'être joué de nous."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e70d6060-0675-4376-a931-315ff4bf408c",
                                                "sense_id": "7ea27eda-dac3-3f72-9ffa-0cd7da686de1",
                                                "text": "Il faut que je te parle rapidement."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "490e3453-7492-47d5-8436-101185531025",
                        "source_entry_id": "d72a8b9c-ffb1-34c1-b726-7798ae9cd0a9",
                        "source_sense_id": "94268663-3504-3036-86dc-dceec6316d31",
